  "id": "kien-truc-dep-phan-1.html",
  "content": "<p>Những kiệt tác kiến trúc được tham khảo từ trang <a href=\"https://korzik.net/userpost/114230-arhitekturnoe-porno.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">KORZIK</a>, trong đó có cả Cầu Vàng ở Đà Nẵng của Việt Nam.</p><p><span id=\"more-3600\"></span></p><p>1/ Ngôi nhà ở Albania, bị phá hủy một phần và được xây dựng lại sau trận động đất</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544882_1-13.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544882_1-13.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"933\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>2. Tòa nhà của Bộ Nông nghiệp Nga, Kazan</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544859_2-13.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544859_2-13.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"1042\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>3. Trần nhà ở khách sạn Gran Hotel Ciudad de México ở Mexico, 1899</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544857_3-13.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544857_3-13.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"902\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>4. Cầu thang xoắn ốc chạm khắc từ gỗ nguyên khối. Lâu đài Lednice, Cộng hòa Séc.</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544897_4-11.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544897_4-11.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"1059\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>5. Đền Giác ngộ, Bangkok – Thái Lan</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544885_5-12.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544885_5-12.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"870\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>6. Nhà phố thời Victoria và hoa tử đằng, San Francisco</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544817_6-10.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544817_6-10.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"871\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>7. Hiệu sách Zhongshuge ở Thành Đô, Trung Quốc</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544830_7-11.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544830_7-11.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"1050\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>8. Cầu thang xoắn ốc do Leonardo da Vinci thiết kế năm 1516</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544854_8-11.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544854_8-11.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"877\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>9. Thư viện Công cộng ở Thành phố Kansas</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544839_9-10.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544839_9-10.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"525\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>10. Bảo tàng lịch sử tự nhiên, London</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544880_10-10.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544880_10-10.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"875\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>11. Cầu vàng, Đà Nẵng, Việt Nam</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544811_11-12.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544811_11-12.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"873\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>12. Budapest, Hungary</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544810_12-10.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544810_12-10.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"875\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>13. Nhà của thợ làm gỗ, đầu những năm 1900, Seattle</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544862_13-10.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544862_13-10.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"897\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>14. Tòa nhà chung cư ở Tel Aviv, Israel</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544885_14-10.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544885_14-10.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"865\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>15. Ngôi nhà theo phong cách Tân nghệ thuật. Brussels, Bỉ</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544867_15-9.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544867_15-9.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"1056\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>16. Trần của nhà thờ Hồi giáo Shah ở Isfahan, Iran</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544811_16-10.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544811_16-10.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"933\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>17. Ngôi nhà nhỏ bằng đá tuyệt vời, Anh</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544831_17-9.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544831_17-9.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"875\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>18. Nhà thờ Hallgrimskirkja. Reykjavik, Iceland</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544812_18-10.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544812_18-10.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"875\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>19. Bể bơi Azure Blue tại Lâu đài Hearst, California</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544900_19-9.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544900_19-9.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"814\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>20. Nhà hàng trên sông Bol. Strasbourg, Pháp</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544810_20-9.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544810_20-9.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"875\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>21. Nhà nguyện Crown of Thorns. Arkansas, Hoa Kỳ</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544823_21-8.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544823_21-8.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"754\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>22. Nhà thờ Milan, Ý</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544864_22-9.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544864_22-9.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"875\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>23. Ngôi nhà thời Victoria khác thường ở San Francisco</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544863_23-9.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544863_23-9.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"756\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>24. Nhà thờ Clermont-Ferrand, được xây dựng hoàn toàn bằng đá núi lửa. Nước pháp</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544832_24-8.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544832_24-8.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"525\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>25. Nhà thờ Grundtvig ở Copenhagen, Đan Mạch</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544846_25-8.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544846_25-8.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"875\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>26. Khách sạn Park Royal, Singapore</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544881_26-8.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544881_26-8.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"875\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>27. Lâu đài Hohenzollern, Đức</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544837_27-5.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544837_27-5.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"874\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>28. Cửa sổ kính màu bên trong nhà nguyện Dos Bosco, Brazil</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544818_28-7.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544818_28-7.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"1093\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>29. Lăng mộ của Ramses II. Thung lũng các vị vua, Ai Cập</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544900_29-7.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544900_29-7.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>30. Một căn nhà ở góc rất hẹp. Amsterdam, Hà Lan</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544881_30-7.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544881_30-7.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"875\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>31. Ngôi nhà trên thác nước, được xây dựng vào năm 1936-1939, Hoa Kỳ</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544897_31-5.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544897_31-5.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"870\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>32. Nhà kính Ý thế kỷ 19 tại Ashby House, Anh</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544886_32-6.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544886_32-6.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"876\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>33. Khung cảnh tuyệt đẹp của nghĩa địa Shakhi-Zinda ở Samarkand, Uzbekistan</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544853_33-6.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544853_33-6.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"875\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>34. Lối vào hộp đêm ở Seoul, Hàn Quốc</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544893_34-6.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544893_34-6.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"875\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>35. Ngôi nhà tân gothic ở Budapest</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544860_35-5.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544860_35-5.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"875\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>36. Ngôi nhà của ông Thomas Chop. Manchester, Anh</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544882_36-6.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544882_36-6.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"1052\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>37. Ngôi nhà ở Bucktown. Chicago, Hoa Kỳ</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544875_37-6.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544875_37-6.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"872\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>38. Đường phố của thị trấn Setenil de las Bodegas, Tây Ban Nha</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544874_38-6.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544874_38-6.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"874\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>39. Tòa nhà Đại học Trinity College, Dublin</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544834_39-6.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544834_39-6.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"874\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>40. Vương cung thánh đường Đức Mẹ Las Lajas ở Nariño, Colombia</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544881_40-6.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544881_40-6.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"875\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>41. Khách sạn ở Quebec, Canada</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544855_41-5.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544855_41-5.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"884\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>42. Ngôi nhà thế kỷ 19 với một sân thượng đôi. New Orleans, Hoa Kỳ</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544821_42-5.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544821_42-5.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"875\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>43. Khu dân cư phức hợp Les Espaces D’abraxas, Pháp</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544828_44-5.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544828_44-5.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"874\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>44. Ô cửa theo trường phái Tân nghệ thuật</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544828_45-5.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544828_45-5.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"1031\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>45. Bảo tàng Hàng hải Vancouver, Canada</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544900_46-5.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544900_46-5.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"851\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>46. Tòa nhà nhiều tầng ở Singapore</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544846_47-4.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544846_47-4.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"876\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>47. Wedekindhaus, bị phá hủy hoàn toàn trong Thế chiến II và được xây dựng lại vào những năm 1980. nước Đức</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544818_48-3.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544818_48-3.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"875\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>48. Một giếng mở rộng được thiết kế đặc biệt cho những người hầu của ngôi nhà. Scotland</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544893_49-3.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544893_49-3.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"875\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>49. Tòa nhà chính của Đại học Công nghệ Warsaw</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544868_50-3.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544868_50-3.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"874\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>50. Ga tàu điện ngầm ở Stockholm, Thụy Điển</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544897_51-2.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544897_51-2.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"875\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>51. Cửa sổ kính màu trong tòa nhà ngân hàng cũ. Budapest, Hungary</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544806_52-1.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544806_52-1.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"1050\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>52. Đền Thánh Tâm Chúa Giêsu ở Barcelona, ​​Tây Ban Nha</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544861_53-1.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544861_53-1.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"1050\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>53. Thành phố có tường bao quanh trên một ngọn đồi ở Siena, Ý</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544856_54-1.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544856_54-1.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"874\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p>54. Đền đồng Ipianvachan trên Thái Lão Sơn, Trung Quốc</p><div class=\"img-in-full\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544903_55-1.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"fr-dib\" data-src=\"https://i0.wp.com/korzik.net/uploads/posts/2021-05/1621544903_55-1.jpg?w=1000&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"875\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"sharedaddy sd-sharing-enabled\"><div class=\"robots-nocontent sd-block sd-social sd-social-icon-text sd-sharing\"><h3 class=\"sd-title\">Chia sẻ bài viết:</h3><div class=\"sd-content\"><ul><li class=\"share-facebook\"><a rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" data-shared=\"sharing-facebook-3600\" class=\"share-facebook sd-button share-icon\" href=\"https://txnam.net/kien-truc-dep-phan-1.html?share=facebook\" target=\"_blank\" aria-labelledby=\"sharing-facebook-3600\">\n<span id=\"sharing-facebook-3600\" hidden=\"\">Share on Facebook (Opens 